# 0.83 %, not 0.63 %.  A predicted delay and an observed one were glued
# together with a comma.  The OBSERVED excess is +1.5025 s = +0.626 %.
#
# What the explicit router costs, MEASURED by halving the driver step
# (the case header shows the student how to reproduce this):
#     deltaT     tracer recovered      loss
#      2.00 s    1.975103e-04 kmol    1.245 %
